d on another card of the same color and cost.\nA multicolored card counts as any one of its colors.\nThere is no turn order. If someone has a card to play in the above sequence, they may play it at any time.\nIf at any point a player notices the sequence has been broken by a card in their hand, they say \"restart\" and reveal the card that should have come next in the sequence. Restart the game by shuffling all cards together and dealing them out again. Use your knowledge of _Magic_ and the cards revealed between restarts to successfully complete the sequence.\nTO WIN:\nThe game is over when all cards have been discarded in the correct order. Keep track of the number of restarts—one or fewer is a victory!","cardTypes":[],"colors":[],"colorIdentity":[],"keywords":[],"legalities":{"standard":"not_legal","pioneer":"not_legal","modern":"not_legal","historic":"not_legal","timeless":"not_legal","pauper":"not_legal","commander":"not_legal","brawl":"not_legal","legacy":"not_legal","vintage":"not_legal"},"imageUrl":"https://cards.scryfall.io/normal/front/5/e/5e7944f4-7bd0-47f4-ac45-ae656672cd29.jpg?1675594743","thumbnailUrl":"https://cards.scryfall.io/small/front/5/e/5e7944f4-7bd0-47f4-ac45-ae656672cd29.jpg?1675594743","power":null,"toughness":null,"isLegendary":false,"canBeCommander":false,"tags":["discard"],"printedNames":["Telepathic Transmission","Telepathic Transmission (cont'd)"]},{"id":"d5aa920e-b93f-41c2-b505-a9350353be8b","oracleId":"1b9dd2b6-d14d-4c1e-9885-00ab2c0bf8da","lang":"en","name":"Telekinesis","manaValue":2,"typeLine":"Instant","oracleText":"Tap target creature. Prevent all combat damage that would be dealt by that creature this turn. It doesn't untap during its controller's next two untap steps.","cardTypes":["Instant"],"colors":["U"],"colorIdentity":["U"],"keywords":[],"legalities":{"standard":"not_legal","pioneer":"not_legal","modern":"not_legal","historic":"not_legal","timeless":"not_legal","pauper":"legal","commander":"legal","brawl":"not_legal","lega